   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="transliteration" xml:lang="pal">
            <pb xml:id="pb-1r-trl"/><!-- add facs="" once an image is available -->
            <ab xml:id="MP0602_trl-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p1-l1"/>dʾṭynwndʾṭ MN ẔK Y MN
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p1-l2"/>ml Y plhwṭl ʾwsṭndʾl Y ḆYN
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trl-p1-l3"/>yẓdʾnʾp̄sṭʾn ʿL bwn' ẔNH
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trl-p1-l4"/>BYRḤ ʾp̄ʾn Y ŠNṬ $$ W YWM ʾp̄ʾn
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trl-p1-l5"/>hc-š NSḤWNṭn Y MŠYʾ Y
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trl-p1-l6"/>clʾk Y hm BYRḤ ʾp̄ʾn LʿYN' yẕdʾnpʾṭʾl
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trl-p1-l7"/>ʾp̄ʾdsṭ' lʾd šʾnck I-M ʿL
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trl-p1-l8"/>mṭrʾṭwr' YḤBWNṭn ck' yẕdʾnpʾṭʾl
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trl-p1-l9"/>ḤṬYMWNṭ
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="transcription" xml:lang="pal">
            <ab xml:id="MP0602_trc-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p1-l1"/>Dādēnwindād az ān ī az
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trc-p1-l2"/>mar ī farroxtar ōstāndār ī andar
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trc-p1-l3"/>Yazdānābestān ō bun ēn
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trc-p1-l4"/>māh Ābān ī sāl 40 ud rōz Ābān
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trc-p1-l5"/>az-iš wēxtan ī rōγn ī
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trc-p1-l6"/>čirāγ ī ham māh Ābān pēš Yazdānpādār
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trc-p1-l7"/>abāyist rāy šānčak 1000 ō
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trc-p1-l8"/>Mihr-Ādur dādan čak Yazdānpādār
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trc-p1-l9"/>āwišt
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:id="MP0602_trans-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p1-l1"/>Dādēnwindād from that which (belongs) from
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trans-p1-l2"/>the account of the very fortunate ōstāndār in
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trans-p1-l3"/>Yazdānābestān to the bun: (from az-iš postpos. line 5) this
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trans-p1-l4"/>month Ābān (8th month) of year 40 and day Ābān (10th day)
               <lb n="5-6" xml:id="trans-p1-l5-6"/>onwards because of (rāy, line 7) refining lamp oil which was of want (abāyist, line 7) in the same month Ābān at Yazdānpādār's
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trans-p1-l7"/>šānčak 1000 to
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trans-p1-l8"/>Mihr-Ādur (he was) to give. Yazdānpādār
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trans-p1-l9"/>sealed the čak.
            </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
</TEI>